# Local scratch copy of the R2 bucket, used when bulk-uploading with rclone.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `files` matches a directory of that
# name *anywhere*, which silently kept `src/routes/api/search/files/` — deep
# search's entire endpoint — out of version control.
/files

# Playwright's output. Anchored to the repo root for the same reason as `/files`
# above: an unanchored name would also ignore any directory of that name deeper in
# the tree. Prettier and eslint both read this file, so these stay out of the
# format and lint checks too. See docs/testing.md.
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/
